    "regime_notes": "Regime IC: 2026-07-16 to 2027-12-31 +0.059347 (368 dates); 2028-01-01 to 2029-12-31 -0.003558 (521); 2030-01-01 to 2032-12-31 +0.032178 (784); 2033-01-01 to 2034-11-09 +0.028432 (473). Interpret conservatively due to 15-instrument cross-section.",
